-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Target model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The draft model was trained on greedy outputs and hidden states of
Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B (revision 7278e1e70fe206f11671096ffdd38061171dd6e5; the same
weights as Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B-hf revision bcd2b5b7f32b480ab5790554cfa8347f246a14f3),
Copyright Alibaba Qwen team, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B
The draft is used together with the target model's own token embedding and LM head,
which are loaded from the target checkpoint and are not modified or redistributed.

Method: DFlash block-diffusion speculative drafting, arXiv:2602.06036. The checkpoint
uses the public DFlash checkpoint format (z-lab/dflash, MIT License).

