Training data (audio and transcripts; no source audio is redistributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- LibriSpeech ASR corpus (c) 2014 Vassil Panayotov, CC BY 4.0
  (https://www.openslr.org/12), derived from LibriVox public-domain recordings.
  Panayotov et al., ICASSP 2015. HF: openslr/librispeech_asr.
- LibriTTS-R, CC BY 4.0 (https://www.openslr.org/141). Koizumi et al., 2023;
  derived from LibriTTS (Zen et al., 2019). HF: mythicinfinity/libritts_r.
- Multilingual LibriSpeech (English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese,
  Dutch, Polish), CC BY 4.0 (https://www.openslr.org/94). Pratap et al., 2020.
  HF: parler-tts/mls_eng, facebook/multilingual_librispeech.
- Common Voice Corpus 17.0, Mozilla Foundation, CC0 1.0. Ardila et al., LREC 2020.
